  `Microsoft.Dynamics.Client.ServerForm.TaskRecording` data contract, the
  action tree under <RootScope><Children>, the `z:Id` / `z:Ref` object-graph
  attributes, the <UserActions> list of back-references, and the five node
  kinds the recorder emits - Scope, MenuItemUserAction, CommandUserAction,
  PropertyUserAction, TaskUserAction - plus InfoUserAction for a recorded note.

